# AuraGlass {{version}}

> React 19 component system with a layered glass material (`aura-glass`). Import components by canonical name, style them through `data-ag-part` and `data-state` attributes and the `ag` cascade layer, and add certified registry blocks with `aura-glass-cli`. This file is generated from `package.json`, the exports manifest and the component metas; version {{version}}.
