## Install

- `npm install {{install}}`
- `npx aura-glass-cli init` (writes `auraglass.json` and the `aura-glass/styles.css` import plus layer statement)
- `npx aura-glass-cli add <block>` (shadcn-format registry items)
- Upgrading from 4.x: `npx aura-glass-cli migrate 4to5 --dry-run`
- MCP server for agents: `npx aura-glass-mcp` (stdio; tools `search_components`, `get_component`, `list_registry`, `get_registry_item`, `get_migration`)

